<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Leasing Solutions cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Leasing Solutions cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>- EVEREN Securities Inc said Tuesday it cut its intermediate-term rating on Leasing Solutions Inc to market performer from outperformer. The firm said it is maintaining its long-term outperform rating on the stock.</p>
<p>- EVEREN also cut its 1998 earnings estimate to $1.70 from $1.85 a share.</p>
<p>- EVEREN cited Dell Computer Corp's decision to form an affiliate leasing company with a Canadian firm. Dell is Leasing Solution's largest vendor partner, EVEREN said.  </p>
<p>- Leasing Solutions expects to replace much of the lost Dell volume through increased volume to other companies, as well as expansion in Canada and Europe, EVEREN said.</p>
<p>- &quot;(P)atient investors will be rewarded over the next 18 months,&quot; EVEREN said in a statement.</p>
<p>- Leasing Solutions traded up 3/4 at 8-5/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
